flowchart TD
    A[Execute kb_fix_skill] --> B{fixTags?}
    B -->|Yes| C[Check required tags]
    C --> D{Missing any?}
    D -->|Yes| E[Add missing tags:<br/>type, kind, skill_ref,<br/>skill_name, audience,<br/>format, source]
    D -->|No| F[Skip tag fix]
    
    B -->|No| F
    
    F --> G{fixFrontmatter?}
    G -->|Yes| H[Parse inner frontmatter]
    H --> I{Has name & description?}
    I -->|Yes & match| J[No change]
    I -->|Missing or mismatch| K[Add/repair inner fm<br/>with correct values]
    G -->|No| J
    
    J --> L{enable?}
    L -->|Yes| M[skill:disabled → skill:enabled]
    L -->|No| N[Keep existing status]
    
    M --> O[Write updated ARTICLE.md]
    N --> O
    K --> O
    E --> O
    
    O --> P[Return action report]
